Here are some suggestions for limiting the power of the ring of conflict:

1) Have it affect only monsters who respect Elbereth (ie., not @).

2) Have it use up much more food than even the ring of regeneration, so that
   anyone wearing it has to eat every 3 or 4 rounds.

3) Give every monster a % chance of escaping its effects.

4) Make it extremely rare (like named artifacts), so that one usually needs
   a wish to get it.

There is no need to adapt all of these, any one will probably do.


